non-negative:
\deqn{\widehat{Var}(A/B) \approx \frac{Var(A) + (A/B)^2\, Var(B)}{B^2}}

\strong{C1 to C2 fallback.} The fallback is never silent. When a Family C1
row yields a negative subset variance, the MOE is recomputed with the
